      "message": "IIUC, previously since `usage` didn\u0027t exist on `TextureViewDescriptor`, creating a view with a format that does not support `StorageBinding` from a texture with a format that supported `StorageBinding` would\u0027ve automatically worked and not generated a validation error unless we later on used the view as storage.\n\nNow, if the user doesn\u0027t explicitly remove `StorageBinding` in `usage`, we will fail validation earlier. If this is true, this might be an unintentionally breaking change?",
